{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22967","headline":"雨中赴刘十九二林之期及到寺刘已先去因以四韵寄之 · 白居易","name":"雨中赴刘十九二林之期及到寺刘已先去因以四韵寄之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云中台殿泥中路，既阻同游嬾却还。\n将谓独愁犹对雨，不知多兴已寻山。\n才应行到千峰里，只校来迟半日间。\n最惜杜鹃花烂熳，春风吹尽不同攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22967.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22967","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}